# Nobody is Reading Your Emails

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/low-customer-engagement/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

Let's be honest: your customers have hundreds of unread emails. If you're still relying on email for urgent stuff like sale alerts or reminders, you're probably being ignored. We fix this by moving your most important messages to where people actually look—SMS and WhatsApp.